WEBVTT

00:48:29.079 --> 00:48:30.983
"People keep asking me how I'm doing,

00:48:31.007 --> 00:48:33.089
and I'm not always sure
how to answer that.

00:48:33.113 --> 00:48:35.385
It depends on the day.
It depends on the minute.

00:48:35.409 --> 00:48:38.990
Right this moment, I'm OK.
Yesterday, not so good.

00:48:39.014 --> 00:48:41.087
Tomorrow, we'll see.

00:48:41.111 --> 00:48:43.590
Here is what I have learned
about grief, though.

00:48:43.614 --> 00:48:44.830
Grief says to me,

00:48:44.854 --> 00:48:47.346
"You will never love anyone
the way you loved Rayya,"

00:48:47.370 --> 00:48:50.798
and I reply, "I am willing
for that to be true."

00:48:50.822 --> 00:48:54.285
Grief says, "She's gone
and she's never coming back."

00:48:54.309 --> 00:48:57.472
I reply, "I am willing
for that to be true."

00:48:57.496 --> 00:49:00.127
Grief says, "You'll never
hear that laugh again."